## Installation

The SDK requires Java 11 or later and is published to Maven Central as `{{ sdk.namespace | caseDot }}:{{ sdk.gitRepoName | caseDash }}`. Make sure `mavenCentral()` is among your repositories, then add the dependency.

Gradle Kotlin DSL (`build.gradle.kts`):

```kotlin
dependencies {
    implementation("{{ sdk.namespace | caseDot }}:{{ sdk.gitRepoName | caseDash }}:{{ sdk.version }}")
}
```

Gradle Groovy (`build.gradle`):

```groovy
dependencies {
    implementation '{{ sdk.namespace | caseDot }}:{{ sdk.gitRepoName | caseDash }}:{{ sdk.version }}'
}
```

Maven (`pom.xml`):

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>{{ sdk.namespace | caseDot }}</groupId>
    <artifactId>{{ sdk.gitRepoName | caseDash }}</artifactId>
    <version>{{ sdk.version }}</version>
</dependency>
```
